      "id": "claim_048f8a6fcc374f7a825278eda1d87952",
      "statement": "`NUXT_PUBLIC_*` values are exposed through Nuxt public runtime configuration and are embedded during the build path: the Docker builder receives them as `ARG` values, exports them before `pnpm build`, and the application uses them for browser-visible API and feature configuration. Changing them requires rebuilding the generated output or image.",
