      "statement": "The shared HTTP client defaults to a 10-second timeout, retries status codes 408, 429, 500, 502, 503, and 504 three times with a one-second delay, logs request and response URLs, and selects form encoding for ordinary non-GET bodies unless `useJson` is enabled.",
